{
 "description": "NAME_ENT.EXN's opening narration (the legend of the tree), the prologue title and two labels. The kana grid, the opening song's lyrics (rule 9) and the name-entry easter eggs stay Japanese. Promoted into the normal build on the user's request without an on-screen check (only the static checks: draft.py --check, packing, and a whole-set build). Not seen: the opening narration needs a real new game.",
 "strings": [
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A718",
   "original": "始まりがあれば終わりがあるように、",
   "text": "As all beginnings have an end,"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
