   "text": "A love that never ends"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A77C",
   "original": "それはどんなに幸せなことでしょう。",
   "text": "how wonderful that would be."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A7A0",
   "original": "ここ、きらめき高校には、",
   "text": "Here at Kirameki High,"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A7BC",
   "original": "一つの伝説があります。",
   "text": "there is a legend."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A7D4",
   "original": "校庭のはずれにある一本の古木。",
   "text": "An old tree by the schoolyard."
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A7F4",
   "original": "そのたもとで卒業の日に、",
   "text": "Beneath it, at graduation,"
