  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A810",
   "original": "女の子からの告白で生まれた",
   "text": "lovers born of a girl's"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A82C",
   "original": "恋人達は、永遠に幸せな関係に",
   "text": "confession are happy forever"
  },
  {
   "file": "CDROM/EXEDIR/NAME_ENT.EXN",
   "offset": "0x1A84C",
   "original": "なれるという伝説が…",
   "text": "so the legend says..."
